--- !u!114 &831988021
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 831988019}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1831e9905bd00a94390576154b76f0e9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialMessages:
  - Ok Human lets get you used to combat. I'll start with something easy, try walking
    forwards to the next area.
  - Fantastic, now you will have to dash to get across this gap. Try not falling
    off the map, that would be super embarrassing.
  - Any demon worth thier salt needs to be able to fight, try hitting this slime
    with your melee weapon a few times. Show them who's in charge here.
  - Great work, you really showed him who's the boss didn't you?
  - Next I want you to use your ranged magic on this helpless slime. Using magic
    will consume mana. If you ever run out wait a bit and you will be fine.
  - Try using your special abilities next. They will be much more powerful than your
    basic attacks but you will have to wait before you can use them again.
  - Lets get you a familiar..... uhhh here's this slime I guess. Wow a new friend
    just for you! No need to thank me consider this a signing bonus.Try activating
    their ultimate ability to gain the upper hand in combat.
  - Great work human! Go through the portal and cause some chaos you little demon.
    Careful not to die or you will lose your items and cash. I'll be rooting for
    you, go raise some hell.
  tutorialAlternateMessages:
  - Stop wasting my time and WALK FORWARDS MORON!
  - Hey its ok, not everyone was born to jump over short distances take your time
    champ.
  - Hit the slime with your melee weapon ok? Just smack him please its not that hard.
  - Great work, you really showed him whos in charge didn't you?
  - Oh my lord of hells what are you doing! HIT THE SLIME WITH YOUR RANGED MAGIC!
  - Listen to what I'm saying ok? Use your special ability, not your basic attacks.
  - Lets get you a familiar, they will fight beside you and much more. Try activating
    thier ultimate ability to gain the upper hand in combat.
  - You sure like taking your time don't you? Get a move on! Time is money ya know.
  tutUIManager: {fileID: 635567860}
  objectsToDisableDuringTut: []
  objectsToDisablePostTut:
  - {fileID: 635567859}
  inTut: 0
